{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2021-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1616544000, "end_date": 1617235199, "month_true_total": 238, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "89436858", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028068160", "personaname": "Saukuy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/saukuy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 2884, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 181, "last_played": 1756666428, "avatar": "018ec709768afb9b55f11930e619747028ce36a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a hard one to get into. Mechanically, the combat feels decent and movement alright. Visually its fine (barring some weirdness here and there). As a Mass Effect game? Feels like a shoddy fan-fic. Characters swing from forgettably bland to downright irritating, the plot is poorly thought through (looked into it after stopping gameplay) and the gameplay is hollow and aimless. The game takes a lot of mechanics from Dragon Age Inquisition, to its own detriment. I broke down just as the game began to open up, because the game world was boring me to sleep and the characters were getting progressively more agonising to listen to. Pretty damning for an RPG game. \n\nOn its own, it is a mediocre sci-fantasy RPG with a couple of decent mechanics and a goofy story. As part of the Mass Effect games, its a hollow shell and a case study in Bioware's progressive decline in quality as a company. There are substantially better games available to spend your time and money on and if you REALLY want to relive the ME setting... just replay the old titles. This one ain't worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1617202547, "timestamp_updated": 1617202547, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.521512687206268311", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "89435150", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087845113", "personaname": "RhaineKyree", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198087845113/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1323, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 760, "last_played": 1635555083, "avatar": "271c8e63129862c5fcf82448fd3474fe48408caf"}, "language": "english", "review": "I enjoyed the original Mass Effect story line more but this is still fun and a good way to loose yourself in the Mass Effect universe.", "timestamp_created": 1617200724, "timestamp_updated": 1617200724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "89425823", "author": {"steamid": "76561198236439476", "personaname": "505th \"Reaver\"", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198236439476/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 30274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11548, "last_played": 1704231282, "avatar": "3ac013a988d244215722b1c04bfc149668d50cf8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Play if ya want, I enjoyed it.", "timestamp_created": 1617189860, "timestamp_updated": 1617189860, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "89393113",